        },
        {
          "source": "spec",
          "quote": "SN74LVC1G07, parts U15, U22, U35, U36, wired as /OE-controlled sinks"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "If the MPN is what gets assembled, the outputs will not have the specified open-drain behavior. They may actively drive high where the sink circuit expects a released output, potentially causing contention or incorrect e-stop signaling.",
      "confidence": 0.85
